-- ANIMAL SHAPESHIFTER: one power, several animal forms. Every form is an
-- ability of kind "Form": press its key to change (a short, interruptible
-- transition that costs Primal), press it again to change back. Primal drains
-- while transformed and refills in human form; at 0 you are forced back.
-- While transformed, Light and Heavy become the animal's own attacks (Heavy is
-- its signature move) and the form's stats replace the human ones: speed,
-- health, armour, dodge and guard, and how big a target it is.
-- Forms evolve with degree under the same ability id (degreeScaling).
--
-- Fields are the same as Strong Dude's (see StrongDude.luau). Form abilities add:
--   form = {
--     animal     which body the client builds (changes with degree)
--     drain      Primal per second while in this form
--     gravity    aerial forms: share of gravity felt while transformed (glide)
--     stats      combat overrides merged over the human profile
--     basic      { Light = abilityId, Heavy = abilityId } while in this form
--   }
--   cost on a form is paid when transforming; changing back is free.
--   cooldown on a form is the shared switch cooldown (every form waits for it).

local rgb = Color3.fromRGB

-- Dodge invulnerability for the quick forms (evading is their defense)
local function quickDodge(invulnerable: number, forward: number)
	return {
		Invulnerable = invulnerable,
		Directions = {
			Side = { Invulnerable = invulnerable },
			Back = { Invulnerable = invulnerable },
			Forward = { Invulnerable = forward },
		},
	}
end

